323
00:26:33,369 --> 00:26:41,226
A very important event occurred about 14 months into the Hijrah(هجرة) of Rasool Allah ﷺ

324
00:26:42,091 --> 00:26:44,958
and that was the change of the Qibla(قبله).

325
00:26:46,193 --> 00:26:49,884
In Makkah Rasool Allah ﷺ would pray towards Jerusalem.

326
00:26:50,225 --> 00:26:53,313
But he would have Al-Ka'aba(اَلْكَعْبَه) between him and Jerusalem.

327
00:26:53,353 --> 00:26:57,027
So, he would be facing and Al-Ka'aba(اَلْكَعْبَه), and also facing Jerusalem

328
00:26:58,967 --> 00:27:04,186
But now when he is in Madina, Al-Ka'aba(اَلْكَعْبَه) is the opposite direction of Jerusalem.

329
00:27:04,591 --> 00:27:08,059
So, when he was praying, his back was towards Al-Ka'aba(اَلْكَعْبَه)

330
00:27:09,716 --> 00:27:12,926
Rasool Allah ﷺ wanted to face Al-Ka'aba(اَلْكَعْبَه).

331
00:27:13,244 --> 00:27:16,196
