332
00:27:17,585 --> 00:27:27,565
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ revealed Ayaat(آيات) in which the Muslims were told to now face the Qibla(قبله) of Ibrahimعليه السّلام,

333
00:27:28,461 --> 00:27:29,506
to face Al-Ka'aba(اَلْكَعْبَه).

334
00:27:30,688 --> 00:27:34,672
Rasool Allah ﷺ prayed towards the new Qibla(قبله)

335
00:27:35,565 --> 00:27:41,319
And one of the Sahabah, who was with him, went back to his people,

336
00:27:41,549 --> 00:27:44,342
who were a few miles out of Madina.

337
00:27:44,652 --> 00:27:47,890
And he found them praying Asr(عصر) towards Jerusalem,

338
00:27:47,945 --> 00:27:50,033
so he told them while they were in Salah(صلاة).

339
00:27:50,468 --> 00:27:57,124
 He told them, I testify, I bear witness that I just prayed with Rasool Allah ﷺ towards Makkah.

340
00:27:57,703 --> 00:28:01,185
So, they turned in their Salah(صلاة) to face the new Qibla(قبله)

341
00:28:01,225 --> 00:28:04,098
 that shows you the obedience that, they had to Rasool Allah ﷺ.

342
00:28:04,272 --> 00:28:09,122
And also the trust that they had among them, they immediately turned in their Salah(صلاة) and faced the new Qibla(قبله).

343
00:28:10,632 --> 00:28:15,363
But this event didn't pass without causing controversy.

344
00:28:15,601 --> 00:28:18,468
In fact, it was a very controversial event.

345
00:28:19,842 --> 00:28:26,420
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ revealed over 40 Ayaat(آيات) of Surat Ul Baqara(سورة البقرة) dealing with this incident alone.

