00:28:27,536 --> 00:28:31,835
Ibn Al-Qayyim says, this was a test from Allahعَزّوجَلّ for the people.

347
00:28:32,870 --> 00:28:38,464
He said it was a test for the Mushrikeen(مشركين) because the Mushrikeen(مشركين) said;

