684
00:56:09,194 --> 00:56:10,734
And they're going to crowd the Masajid(مساجد).

685
00:56:11,115 --> 00:56:12,980
Why because you're offering them $20.

686
00:56:14,087 --> 00:56:16,221
So, people are not interested in hearing about religion

687
00:56:16,261 --> 00:56:19,695
and that's why, when Rasool Allah ﷺ first made his announcement in Makkah,

688
00:56:19,872 --> 00:56:24,392
that he's a prophet and he gathered the people of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) and He made it seem very urgent and it is urgent.

689
00:56:24,844 --> 00:56:30,194
He was calling Wa Subhaa(واصباحا), and this is the call, this is like dialing 911, it's emergency.

690
00:56:30,360 --> 00:56:34,463
That was how Rasool Allah ﷺ gathered the people and then he told them;

691
00:56:34,788 --> 00:56:37,193
اِنِّيْ نَذِيْرٌلَّكُمْ بَيْنَ يَدَيْ عَذَابٍ اَلِيْمَ

692
00:56:37,385 --> 00:56:41,091
I'm warning you a severe punishment from Allah.

693
00:56:41,250 --> 00:56:42,425
What did Abu Lahab(ابو لهب) say,

694
00:56:43,321 --> 00:56:45,115
 تَبَّ لَّكَ اَلِهَذَا جَمَعْتَنَا

695
00:56:45,559 --> 00:56:48,536
May evil befall you, Is this why you gathered us!

696
00:56:48,950 --> 00:56:53,611
Abu Lahab(ابو لهب) was upset because he closed his shop and came to listen to Muhammadﷺ

697
00:56:53,651 --> 00:56:56,103
and he thought that it was something serious, according to him.

698
00:56:56,309 --> 00:56:59,866
And it turned out to be preaching about religion and it was very upset about it.

699
00:57:00,562 --> 00:57:01,935
That's when the Ayaat(آيات) were revealed

700
00:57:01,975 --> 00:57:03,713
تَبَّتْ يَدَا أَبِي لَهَبٍ وَتَبَّ۝

701
00:57:04,156 --> 00:57:04,837
And then Allah says;

702
00:57:04,877 --> 00:57:06,870
 مَا أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُ مَالُهُ وَمَا كَسَبَ۝

703
00:57:07,099 --> 00:57:08,749
What will his wealth do for him.

704
00:57:09,292 --> 00:57:13,757
This wealth which was keeping him away from Islam, which was preventing him from listening to the message,

705
00:57:13,987 --> 00:57:16,884
which made him upset because Rasool Allah ﷺ, gathered them.

706
00:57:17,299 --> 00:57:20,292
This wealth, what will it do for him on the Day of Judgment, nothing.

707
00:57:20,728 --> 00:57:23,435
 In fact, it will be the reason for his demise.

708
00:57:25,670 --> 00:57:32,006
So, when the Sahabah fought في سبيل الله and brought the people under the rule of Islam,

709
00:57:32,260 --> 00:57:33,323
then they were listening.

710
00:57:33,720 --> 00:57:38,119
Now they were listening because the Sahabah رضي الله عنهم were ruling over them.

711
00:57:38,159 --> 00:57:43,196
 So, they had some authority, to give the people Da'wah(دعوة) and the people were listening very attentively,

712
00:57:43,235 --> 00:57:44,611
because now it's coming from the government.

713
00:57:44,698 --> 00:57:50,841
It's not coming from a preacher, preaching on the corner of the street or in the marketplace,

714
00:57:51,142 --> 00:57:55,326
holding a loudspeaker and people are just walking by closing their ears.

715
00:57:56,350 --> 00:58:02,505
Now it's coming from a place of authority, and that's when the people entered into Islam in multi folds.

716
00:58:03,100 --> 00:58:07,607
In the beginning, when Rasool Allah ﷺ was giving Da'wah(دعوة) in Makkah, only a few people were interested.

717
00:58:08,021 --> 00:58:11,084
However, when Rasool Allah ﷺ established the Islamic State.

718
00:58:11,417 --> 00:58:16,369
Now the tribes were listening, other nations were listening, and they were taking it serious.

719
00:58:16,678 --> 00:58:19,874
And that's when people started becoming Muslim in thousands.

720
00:58:22,215 --> 00:58:24,461
Rasool Allah ﷺ for 13 years and Makkah.

721
00:58:24,691 --> 00:58:27,969
How many followers did he have 100, 200, 300.?

722
00:58:28,950 --> 00:58:32,173
However, in Madina, they were growing by the thousands every year.

723
00:58:33,157 --> 00:58:39,175
So, when Fath Makkah(فتح مكه), Rasool Allah ﷺ had an army of 12,000 or 10,000,

724
00:58:39,921 --> 00:58:44,017
and in Hajjah Tul Widaa(حجة الوداع) Ninety thousand(90,000).

725
00:58:44,844 --> 00:58:49,797
And when he passed away the ones who prayed Salah Tul Janazah(صلاة الجنازه) on him are over 114,000.

726
00:58:51,732 --> 00:58:56,078
So, you can see how the numbers were growing, because now there was authority.

727
00:58:57,761 --> 00:59:00,975
So, what are the stages that Jihad went through?

728
00:59:01,840 --> 00:59:03,727
Ibn Al-Qayyim(إبن القيم) says in Za'ad Al-Ma'ad(ذاد المعاد)

729
00:59:04,467 --> 00:59:08,449
وَكَانَ الجِهَادُ مُحَرَّمًا، ثُمَّ مَأذُوْنًا بِهْ،

730
00:59:09,033 --> 00:59:12,422
ثُمَّ مَأْمُوْرًا بِهْ لِمَنْ بَدَأَهُمْ بِالقِتَالٍ،

731
00:59:12,715 --> 00:59:16,363
 ثُمَّ مَأْمُوْرًا بِهِ لِجَمِيْعِ الْمُشْرِكِيْنَ

732
00:59:17,004 --> 00:59:21,244
Ibn Al-Qayyim(إبن القيم) says; In the beginning, Jihad(جهاد) was not allowed.

733
00:59:22,284 --> 00:59:27,317
It was prohibited, Muslims were not allowed to fight.

734
00:59:28,214 --> 00:59:29,380
Rasool Allah ﷺ says,

735
00:59:29,419 --> 00:59:32,269
 اِصْبِرُوْ فَاِنِّيْ لَمْ اُؤمَرْ بِقِتَالْ

736
00:59:32,309 --> 00:59:34,799
 Be patient because I'm not given permission to fight.

737
00:59:35,355 --> 00:59:38,386
So, In the beginning it was patients which is called Kaff Ul Yadd(كف اليد).

738
00:59:39,410 --> 00:59:40,616
The second stage,  he said,

739
00:59:40,728 --> 00:59:41,828
ثُمَّ مَأذُوْنًا بِهْ

740
00:59:41,868 --> 00:59:44,273
And then it was allowed, merely allowed.

741
00:59:44,596 --> 00:59:49,036
So, it's just allowed it was not instructed not commanded not obligated, it was allowed.

742
00:59:50,413 --> 00:59:52,818
And that is when Allahعَزّوجَلّ reveal the Ayah

743
00:59:52,977 --> 00:59:58,167
 أُذِنَ لِلَّذِينَ يُقَاتَلُونَ بِأَنَّهُمْ ظُلِمُوا ۚ وَإِنَّ اللَّهَ عَلَىٰ نَصْرِهِمْ لَقَدِيرٌ۝

744
00:59:58,278 --> 01:00:00,855
This is Surat Ul Hajj(سورة الحج) verse 39

745
01:00:01,207 --> 01:00:06,823
Permission to fight has been given to those, who are being fought because they were wronged.

746
01:00:07,202 --> 01:00:09,826
And indeed Allah is competent to give them victory.

747
01:00:10,112 --> 01:00:12,239
So, here you have permission, was given to them.

748
01:00:13,001 --> 01:00:18,483
Now, the following stage, As Ibn Al-Qayyim(ابن القيم) says is;

749
01:00:19,340 --> 01:00:22,245
 ثُمَّ مَأْمُوْرًا بِهْ لِمَنْ بَدَأَهُمْ بِقِتَالٍ

750
01:00:22,475 --> 01:00:26,309
 And then they were commanded to fight the ones, who fight them.

751
01:00:26,906 --> 01:00:28,583
So, this was the third stage.

752
01:00:29,043 --> 01:00:32,996
And the Ayah(آية) for that is 190 Surat Tul Baqarah(سورة البقره),

753
01:00:33,416 --> 01:00:34,749
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

754
01:00:35,656 --> 01:00:43,291
 وَقَاتِلُوا فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ الَّذِينَ يُقَاتِلُونَكُمْ وَلَا تَعْتَدُوا ۚ

755
01:00:43,585 --> 01:00:48,313
إِنَّ اللَّهَ لَا يُحِبُّ الْمُعْتَدِينَ۝

756
01:00:49,313 --> 01:00:53,575
Fight in the way of Allah, those who fight you but do not transgress,

757
01:00:53,850 --> 01:00:57,104
indeed Allah does not like the transgressors.

758
01:00:57,731 --> 01:01:00,628
So, here you only fight the ones who transgress against you.

759
01:01:01,610 --> 01:01:03,240
And then the final stage

760
01:01:03,517 --> 01:01:12,113
and this was the stage that represents the final law of Allahعَزّوجَلّ, which applies to the Ummah(امة).

761
01:01:12,487 --> 01:01:14,462
And that is, as Ibn Al-Qayyim(ابن القيم) says,

762
01:01:14,700 --> 01:01:17,970
 ثُمَّ مَأْمُوْرًا بِهِ لِجَمِيْعِ الْمُشْرِكِيْنَ

763
01:01:18,264 --> 01:01:22,685
And then the Messenger of Allah was instructed to fight all the disbelievers.

764
01:01:23,034 --> 01:01:24,367
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

765
01:01:25,106 --> 01:01:36,057
وَقَاتِلُوا الْمُشْرِكِينَ كَافَّةً كَمَا يُقَاتِلُونَكُمْ كَافَّةً ۚ

766
01:01:36,922 --> 01:01:42,933
And fight against the disbelievers collectively, as they fight against you collectively.

767
01:01:43,266 --> 01:01:46,171
And that is you know, also the Hadith(حديث) which is Mutawatir(متواتر).

768
01:01:46,829 --> 01:01:54,837
which is narrated by Al-Bukhari(البخاريْ), Muslim(مسلم) and others and narrated by over 20 Sahabah(صحابى) of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

769
01:01:55,146 --> 01:01:59,564
أُمِرْتُ أَنْ أُقَاتِلَ النَّاسَ حَتَّى يَشْهَدُوْا أَنْ لَّا إِلَهَ إِلَّا الله وَأَنَّ مُحَمدًا رَّسُوْلَ الله،

770
01:01:59,874 --> 01:02:04,874
وَيُقِيْمُوا الصَّلَاةَ، وَيُؤتُوا الزَّكَاةَ، فَإِنْ فَعَلُوْا ذَلِكَ عَصَمُوْا مِنِّيْ دِمَاءَهُمْ وَأَمْوَالَهُمْ

771
01:02:05,072 --> 01:02:07,024
اِلَّابِحَقِّهَا وَحِسَابَهُمْ عَلَى الله

772
01:02:07,898 --> 01:02:12,246
I was instructed to fight the people until they testify that there is no God but Allah,

773
01:02:12,564 --> 01:02:16,846
and that I'm the Messenger of Allah, to establish Salah(صلاة), to pay Zakah(زكاة),

774
01:02:17,060 --> 01:02:25,036
if they do that, they have protected their blood and their wealth and Allah will hold them accountable for their actions or deeds.

775
01:02:25,991 --> 01:02:30,922
So, these are the four stages that Jihad(جهاد) Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله) went through.

776
01:02:31,962 --> 01:02:33,359
So, What are the objectives of it?

777
01:02:33,438 --> 01:02:35,247
Why was Rasool Allah ﷺ fighting.?

778
01:02:36,558 --> 01:02:44,755
Some Ayaat(آيات) in Qur'an give us the, or tell us the objectives of fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله).

779
01:02:45,091 --> 01:02:48,210
The first is the promotion of Islam.

780
01:02:48,464 --> 01:02:51,359
 That's the first objective, the promotion of Islam.

781
01:02:51,891 --> 01:02:53,090
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says,

782
01:02:53,610 --> 01:03:02,835
وَقَاتِلُوهُمْ حَتَّىٰ لَا تَكُونَ فِتْنَةٌ وَيَكُونَ الدِّينُ كُلُّهُ لِلَّهِ ۚ

783
01:03:03,113 --> 01:03:06,129
So, until all the religion is for Allahعَزّوجَلّ.

784
01:03:07,279 --> 01:03:11,803
The second objective, the protection of rituals and worship places,

785
01:03:12,428 --> 01:03:20,348
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says: Indeed Allah defends those who have believed indeed Allah does not like everyone treacherous, and ungrateful.

786
01:03:20,904 --> 01:03:26,238
Permission to fight has been given to those who are being fought, because they are wronged,

787
01:03:26,325 --> 01:03:29,119
and indeed Allah is competent to give them victory.

788
01:03:30,127 --> 01:03:36,263
They are those who have been evicted from their homes without right, only because they say Our Lord is Allah.

789
01:03:36,981 --> 01:03:42,226
And were it not that Allah checks the people, some by means of others,

790
01:03:42,673 --> 01:03:51,304
There would have been demolished monasteries, churches, synagogues, and mosques, in which the name of Allah is much mentioned.

791
01:03:51,499 --> 01:03:58,370
And Allah will surely support those who support Him, Indeed Allah is powerful and Exalted in Might.

792
01:03:59,461 --> 01:04:06,591
And they are those, who, if we give them authority in the land, establish prayer, and give Zakah(زكواة)

793
01:04:06,802 --> 01:04:09,489
and enjoin, what is right and forbid what is wrong.

794
01:04:09,790 --> 01:04:12,893
 And to Allah belongs the outcome of all matters.

795
01:04:13,338 --> 01:04:22,386
So notice here Allahعَزّوجَلّ is saying, and were it not that Allah checks the people, some, by means of others.

796
01:04:22,850 --> 01:04:27,189
There would have been demolished monasteries, churches, synagogues and mosques.

797
01:04:28,562 --> 01:04:33,800
People are checked by fighting, this is called Sunnat-Ul-Mudafiah(سنت المدافعة).

798
01:04:34,244 --> 01:04:40,049
This is a law of Allahعَزّوجَلّ, that has governed the lives of men.

799
01:04:40,978 --> 01:04:49,288
 If it wasn't for this fighting churches would have been demolished, synagogues would have been demolished, and mosques.

800
01:04:49,796 --> 01:04:51,819
 We might have the question,

801
01:04:51,925 --> 01:04:54,918
Why? Why mentioned synagogues and churches.?

802
01:04:55,545 --> 01:04:57,228
 We're talking about Jihad(جهاد) Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله)

803
01:04:57,892 --> 01:05:01,833
 The reason is, we are not the first nation to fight in the path of Allah,

804
01:05:02,083 --> 01:05:05,115
The First Nation to fight in the path of Allah were the children of Israel(اسرائيل).

805
01:05:05,853 --> 01:05:10,054
fighting the path of Allah was not prescribed on Sayyedina Saleh(سيدنا صالح) and his people,

806
01:05:10,463 --> 01:05:13,049
Sayyedina Hood(سيدنا هود) and his people, Nooh(نوح) and his people.

807
01:05:13,502 --> 01:05:19,104
With those Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء), Allahعَزّوجَلّ will destroy their enemy through a miraculous act.

808
01:05:19,666 --> 01:05:22,174
And they didn't have to involve in fighting themselves.

809
01:05:22,610 --> 01:05:29,058
The First Nation to fight in the path of Allah, are the children of Israel(اسرائيل), the followers of Musaعليه السّلام.

810
01:05:29,683 --> 01:05:37,851
So, because of them being an Ummah(امة) of Jihad(جهاد), synagogues were protected, and churches were protected

811
01:05:38,676 --> 01:05:46,730
and mosques are protected because the Ummah(امة) of Muhammadﷺ are also practicing this act of worship.

812
01:05:48,535 --> 01:05:53,040
The third objective, protecting the world from corruption.

813
01:05:53,484 --> 01:06:01,655
So, rather than fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله), being a cause of corruption, it is a protection for the world, it prevents corruption.

814
01:06:02,420 --> 01:06:06,454
See the Ayaat(آيات) of Allah straighten out the misconceptions that we have.

815
01:06:06,756 --> 01:06:12,682
It clears them because Shaytan(شيطان) is causing us to misunderstand reality,

816
01:06:12,881 --> 01:06:15,975
he makes us think that good is evil and evil is good.

817
01:06:16,268 --> 01:06:18,166
He has that ability of deceiving.

818
01:06:18,372 --> 01:06:21,828
I mean, that's the whole point of him being the devil is, to deceive people

819
01:06:22,155 --> 01:06:25,005
and to make Al-Maroof(معروف) Munkar(منكر), and Munkar(منكر) Maroof(معروف).

820
01:06:25,394 --> 01:06:32,832
So, the Ayaat(آيات) of Qur'an undo the corruption that has caused in our minds because of the Waswash(وسوسه) of Shaytan(شيطان).

821
01:06:33,312 --> 01:06:39,400
The Ayaat(آيات) of Qur'an, cleanse our hearts from the corruption that is caused by the media,

822
01:06:39,781 --> 01:06:43,558
and by the false authority that exists on Earth.

823
01:06:44,035 --> 01:06:50,898
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling us that Jihad(جهاد) Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله), actually limits the corruption that exists on land.

824
01:06:51,385 --> 01:06:52,414
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

825
01:06:52,533 --> 01:07:05,221
وَلَوْلَا دَفْعُ اللَّهِ النَّاسَ بَعْضَهُمْ بِبَعْضٍ لَفَسَدَتِ الْأَرْضُ وَلَٰكِنَّ اللَّهَ ذُو فَضْلٍ عَلَى الْعَالَمِينَ۝

826
01:07:05,612 --> 01:07:11,106
And, if it were not for Allah checking some people by means of others, The Earth would have been corrupted,

827
01:07:11,418 --> 01:07:14,187
but Allah is full of bounty to the worlds.

828
01:07:15,076 --> 01:07:18,544
The fourth objective is to test for mankind it's a trial.

829
01:07:19,194 --> 01:07:23,859
Our existence in this world, as we have been mentioning, is a test from Allahعَزّوجَلّ.

830
01:07:24,105 --> 01:07:26,779
And fighting in His path is part of that test.

831
01:07:26,955 --> 01:07:28,240
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

832
01:07:28,533 --> 01:07:33,716
 ذَٰلِكَ وَلَوْ يَشَاءُ اللَّهُ لَانْتَصَرَ مِنْهُمْ وَلَٰكِنْ لِيَبْلُوَ بَعْضَكُمْ بِبَعْضٍ ۗ

833
01:07:34,278 --> 01:07:40,802
 That is the command. And if Allah had willed, He could have taken vengeance upon them himself.

834
01:07:41,136 --> 01:07:46,445
But he ordered armed struggle to test some of you by means of others.

835
01:07:46,812 --> 01:07:49,438
So, armed struggle is a test for the believers.

836
01:07:49,819 --> 01:07:52,136
And it's a test for the disbelievers.

837
01:07:52,573 --> 01:07:57,335
It's a test for the believers because it tests their patience, it tests their sacrifice.

838
01:07:58,037 --> 01:08:04,470
The ultimate sacrifice that a believer could give to Allahعَزّوجَلّ is to sacrifice his soul and his wealth.

839
01:08:05,129 --> 01:08:11,889
It's a test of whether you fear Allahعَزّوجَلّ more than the creation, or the you fear the creation more than Allah.

840
01:08:12,174 --> 01:08:16,227
So, it tests a lot of what is called Amaal-Al-Quloob(اعمال القلوب), the deeds of the heart.

841
01:08:16,902 --> 01:08:19,219
We might have a lot of diseases in our hearts.

842
01:08:19,544 --> 01:08:27,273
But these diseases don't show up, until we are involved in this act of worship then these diseases show up.

843
01:08:28,218 --> 01:08:32,549
So for example, many of the Munafiqeen(منافقين) blended very well in the society.

844
01:08:32,962 --> 01:08:39,518
They were only exposed in the Battle of Badr(بدر) and in the Battle of Uhud(اُحَد) and the sequence of battles that followed that.

845
01:08:39,819 --> 01:08:41,508
And that's why Allahعَزّوجَلّ says about them.

846
01:08:41,611 --> 01:08:51,122
أَوَلَا يَرَوْنَ أَنَّهُمْ يُفْتَنُونَ فِي كُلِّ عَامٍ مَرَّةً أَوْ مَرَّتَيْنِ

847
01:08:51,407 --> 01:08:54,700
Don't they see that, they are being tested every year once or twice,

848
01:08:55,001 --> 01:08:59,378
because of the average of the Ghazawaat(غزوات) of Rasool Allah ﷺ, per year where one or two.

849
01:08:59,758 --> 01:09:05,362
So, their hypocrisy was showing up, in these battles because that's the ultimate test.

850
01:09:06,410 --> 01:09:10,468
Number five, to punish and humiliate the enemies of Allahعَزّوجَلّ,

851
01:09:10,508 --> 01:09:11,857
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says,

852
01:09:12,115 --> 01:09:25,442
وَأَعِدُّوا لَهُمْ مَا اسْتَطَعْتُمْ مِنْ قُوَّةٍ وَمِنْ رِبَاطِ الْخَيْلِ تُرْهِبُونَ بِهِ عَدُوَّ اللَّهِ وَعَدُوَّكُمْ

853
01:09:26,216 --> 01:09:34,690
وَعَدُوَّكُمْ وَآخَرِينَ مِنْ دُونِهِمْ لَا تَعْلَمُونَهُمُ اللَّهُ يَعْلَمُهُمْ ۚ

854
01:09:35,118 --> 01:09:46,567
وَمَا تُنْفِقُوا مِنْ شَيْءٍ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ يُوَفَّ إِلَيْكُمْ وَأَنْتُمْ لَا تُظْلَمُونَ۝

855
01:09:46,927 --> 01:09:52,267
And prepare against them whatever you are able of power and of steeds of war,

856
01:09:52,501 --> 01:09:57,093
by which you may terrify the enemy of Allah and your enemy

857
01:09:57,148 --> 01:10:02,045
and others besides them whom you do not know, but whom Allah knows.

858
01:10:02,346 --> 01:10:07,969
And whatever you spend in the cause of Allah, will be fully repaid to you, and you will not be wronged.

859
01:10:08,342 --> 01:10:11,453
This is Surat-Ul-Anfaal(أنفال) Verse 60.

860
01:10:12,465 --> 01:10:16,332
Allahعَزّوجَلّ also says in Surat-Tut-Tobah(سورة التوبة), verse 14 and 15

861
01:10:16,665 --> 01:10:29,854
قَاتِلُوهُمْ يُعَذِّبْهُمُ اللَّهُ بِأَيْدِيكُمْ وَيُخْزِهِمْ وَيَنْصُرْكُمْ عَلَيْهِمْ وَيَشْفِ صُدُورَ قَوْمٍ مُؤْمِنِينَ َ

862
01:10:30,564 --> 01:10:33,629
وَيُذْهِبْ غَيْظَ قُلُوبِهِمْ ۗ

863
01:10:33,890 --> 01:10:42,101
وَيَتُوبُ اللَّهُ عَلَىٰ مَنْ يَشَاءُ ۗ وَاللَّهُ عَلِيمٌ حَكِيمٌ۝

864
01:10:42,379 --> 01:10:48,796
Fight them, Allah will punish them, by your hands and disgrace them and give you victory over them

865
01:10:49,034 --> 01:10:54,589
and satisfy the breasts of believing people and remove the fury in their hearts

866
01:10:54,796 --> 01:10:59,852
and Allah turns in forgiveness to whom He wills, and Allah is knowing and Wise.

867
01:11:00,587 --> 01:11:03,791
And Allahعَزّوجَلّ says in Surat-Tul-Anfal(سورة الأنفال) verse 17 and 18,

868
01:11:04,037 --> 01:11:08,346
that is so and also that Allah will weaken the plot of the disbelievers.

869
01:11:08,730 --> 01:11:11,548
So, fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله) will weaken the plot of the disbelievers.

870
01:11:12,082 --> 01:11:16,103
The beginning of the Ayah(آية) says; and you did not kill them but it was Allah, who kill them.

871
01:11:16,491 --> 01:11:20,492
And you threw not or Muhammad(محمد) when you threw, but it was Allah who threw,

872
01:11:20,781 --> 01:11:23,051
that He might test the believers with a good test.

873
01:11:23,130 --> 01:11:29,428
Indeed Allah is hearing and knowing, that is so, and also that Allah will weaken the plot of the disbelievers.

874
01:11:30,161 --> 01:11:34,467
The sixth objective is the exposing of the hypocrites and we talked about this a bit.

875
01:11:35,359 --> 01:11:43,637
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says; Allah would not leave the believers in that state you are in presently, until he separates the evil from the good.

876
01:11:43,824 --> 01:11:47,296
So, the way the separation happens is by fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله)

877
01:11:47,327 --> 01:11:49,097
these Ayaat(آيات) were revealed after Ghawat-Uhud(غزواة احد)

878
01:11:49,437 --> 01:11:53,112
because Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابئ), withdrew with one third of the army.

879
01:11:53,790 --> 01:11:57,422
This is verse 179, in Surat-Al-Imran(سورة العمران).

880
01:11:57,803 --> 01:12:03,307
The seventh objective, it is a defense against the aggression of the enemies of Allah,

881
01:12:03,872 --> 01:12:06,587
who planned to transgress against the Ummah(أمة).

882
01:12:07,040 --> 01:12:08,421
 So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

883
01:12:08,737 --> 01:12:14,634
فَقَاتِلْ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ لَا تُكَلَّفُ إِلَّا نَفْسَكَ ۚ

884
01:12:14,959 --> 01:12:18,416
وَحَرِّضِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۖ

885
01:12:18,664 --> 01:12:24,592
عَسَى اللَّهُ أَنْ يَكُفَّ بَأْسَ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا ۚ

886
01:12:24,957 --> 01:12:32,099
وَاللَّهُ أَشَدُّ بَأْسًا وَأَشَدُّ تَنْكِيلًا۝

887
01:12:32,765 --> 01:12:38,349
So, fight O Muhammad(محمد) in the cause of Allah, you're not held responsible except for yourself,

888
01:12:38,934 --> 01:12:41,125
and encourage the believers to join you,

889
01:12:41,403 --> 01:12:46,497
that perhaps Allah will restrain the military might of those who disbelieve.

890
01:12:47,056 --> 01:12:49,235
And Allah is greater in Might and stronger in punishment.

891
01:12:49,307 --> 01:12:55,318
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ did not say that Da'wah(دعوة) will restrain the military might of those, who disbelieve.

892
01:12:55,358 --> 01:13:01,850
He didn't say that involving in dialogue or discourse will weaken the military might of those who disbelieve.

893
01:13:02,167 --> 01:13:07,241
Allahعَزّوجَلّ said that the way to weaken the military might of those who disbelieve is to fight.

894
01:13:07,832 --> 01:13:13,135
وَصَلَّى الله عَلى سَيَّدِنَا محمد وَعَلى اَلِهِ وَ صَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ تَسْلِيْمًا كَثِيْرًاَ

